# Example: arithmetic methods

## Schema

```
Game = PlayArea Ball
PlayArea = Rect
Rect = Int/x Int/y Int/width Int/height
Ball = Int/x Int/y Int/dx Int/dy Int/rad
```

## Construction

```
[:Game
  [:PlayArea [0 0 800 600]]
  [:Ball 100 100 1 1 5]
]
```

## Methods

```
Rect::area = { width * height }

Rect::doubleWidth = { [:Rect | width = (width * 2)] }

Ball::move = { [:Ball | x = (x + dx), y = (y + dy)] }

Game::widen = { [:Game | playArea.rect.width = (playArea.rect.width * 2)] }

Rect::wrapX = { x % width }
```

## Target

```
%terminal

%main
public static function main():Void {
    var game = GameAssemblage.factory();
    var helper = new WCHNTHelper();
    trace(game.toConstruction(0, helper));
}
```
